<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <%- include('partials/head') %>
    <title>Privacy Policy — OutRay</title>
    <style>
        .legal-content { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.8; }
        .legal-content h2 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; margin-top: 48px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #fff; }
        .legal-content p { margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--muted); }
        .legal-content ul { margin-bottom: 24px; padding-left: 20px; color: var(--muted); }
        .legal-content li { margin-bottom: 10px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <canvas id="net-canvas"></canvas>
    <%- include('partials/nav') %>

    <section style="padding-top: 160px;">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="anim-fade">
                <h1 class="section-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
                <p class="section-sub">Last updated: April 2026</p>
            </div>

            <div class="legal-content anim-fade" style="margin-top: 64px;">
                <p>At OutRay, accessible from OutRay-server.com, one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors. This Privacy Policy document contains types of information that is collected and recorded by OutRay and how we use it.</p>
                
                <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
                <p>We only collect information that is strictly necessary to provide our tunneling services:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Account Information:</strong> Email and username when you register via GitHub or Google.</li>
                    <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> We log request metadata (method, path, status) flowing through your tunnels for your own inspection in the dashboard.</li>
                    <li><strong>Auth Tokens:</strong> Secure tokens generated to authenticate your CLI client.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>2. How we use your information</h2>
                <p>We use the information we collect to operate, maintain, and provide the features and functionality of the Service, including to track your tunnels and provide debugging logs.</p>

                <h2>3. Data Security</h2>
                <p>We implement professional security measures to protect your data. All tunnel traffic is encrypted using TLS 1.3. We do not inspect the content of your tunnel traffic unless required by law.</p>

                <h2>4. Contact Us</h2>
                <p>If you have additional questions or require more information about our Privacy Policy, do not hesitate to contact us at legal@OutRay-server.com.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>

    <script>
        gsap.to('.anim-fade', {opacity:1, y:0, duration:0.8, stagger:0.2, ease:'power2.out'});
        <%- include('partials/network_js') %>
    </script>
</body>
</html>
